# Prettier ignore. We're rolling out prettier as a CI gate without doing a
# whole-tree reformat in the same PR — that would explode the diff and make
# `git blame` useless. Strategy:
#
#   1. This file currently ignores EVERYTHING (`**/*`).
#   2. Then we un-ignore specific files/directories one at a time as we
#      reformat them and verify the diff looks right.
#   3. Once enough surface area is covered, flip the policy and ignore only
#      the auto-generated paths (node_modules, dist, etc).
#
# To start gating a new file, ADD a `!path/to/file` line at the bottom.

# --- bulk ignore -------------------------------------------------------------
**/*

# --- auto-generated / vendored (would be excluded anyway) --------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.foldo-storage/
.foldo-email-outbox/
playwright-report/
test-results/
package-lock.json
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- opt-in: files prettier IS allowed to check ------------------------------
# (Empty for now. Add `!path/to/file.ts` lines here as files are reformatted.)
